<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Credito Provincial in capital increase.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Credito Provincial in capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in private Argentina's Banco Credito Provincial increased its capital by 40 million pesos (dollars), the central bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The capital increase &quot;has consolidated the solvency&quot; of the bank, the central bank said in a news release.</p>
<p>Banco Credito Provincial has 67 branches.</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires newsroom +541 415-2571))</p>
